>>>

<<<
 question would not be good sense or practicable policy; & no wise man would expect to get serviceable recruits for the Army from Ireland in this way. The policy was certainly practicable, for it was carried out;
===
 question would not be good sense or* practicable *policy; & no wise man would expect to get serviceable recruits for the Army from Ireland in this way.* The policy was certainly practicable, for it was carried out;
>>>

